<!-- The word पत्र, drawn as a vector so the launcher icon never upscales a
     bitmap. The two paths are the brand kit's own outlines — the two glyph
     clusters, shaped by HarfBuzz off Tiro Devanagari Sanskrit — and the group
     is its `assets/branding/patra-foreground.svg` transform, unchanged: it
     places the word's bounding box dead centre on the 1024 canvas, which is
     what keeps it inside the middle 66dp of the 108dp adaptive canvas that is
     guaranteed visible.

     Regenerate from the kit rather than hand-edit, and regenerate
     patra_mark_mono.xml with it: the two are the same geometry and a launcher
     that asked for one and got the other would show a different mark. -->
